Format: 3.0 (quilt)
Source: qcma
Binary: qcma, qcma-cli
Architecture: any
Version: @VERSION@
Maintainer: codestation <codestation@megpoid.dev>
Homepage: https://github.com/codestation/qcma
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/codestation/qcma
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/codestation/qcma.git
DEBTRANSFORM-RELEASE: 1
DEBTRANSFORM-TAR: qcma-0.5.3.tar.gz
DEBTRANSFORM-FILES-TAR: debian.tar.xz
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake (>= 3.21), ninja-build, libavcodec-dev, libavformat-dev, libswscale-dev, qt6-base-dev, qt6-base-dev-tools, qt6-l10n-tools, qt6-tools-dev, libnotify-dev, pkg-config, libvitamtp-dev (>= 2.5.12)
Package-List:
 qcma deb utils optional arch=any
 qcma-cli deb utils optional arch=any
